  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34675906",
      "title": "Adding Visual Submission Feedback",
      "lectureOrder": 67,
      "videoOrder": 61,
      "sourceHash": "330f689d0f5a2bdd5ef2df2d8e094712ca0f9fd0e7c8778e1cb12fb2a10d436b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.47,
          "en": "So now we already learned quite a bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.47,
          "end": 7.44,
          "en": "about actions and forms again, and before we now move",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.44,
          "end": 9.989,
          "en": "on to loaders and to updating and deleting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.989,
          "end": 12.69,
          "en": "there's one last thing related to that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.69,
          "end": 14.13,
          "en": "which I want to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.13,
          "end": 16.23,
          "en": "For that, let's add another expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.23,
          "end": 18.61,
          "en": "and this time, let's maybe name it React course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.16,
          "end": 21.54,
          "en": "and give it this name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.54,
          "end": 23.79,
          "en": "And if I click save expense now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.79,
          "end": 27.3,
          "en": "you will notice that essentially for a short timeframe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.3,
          "end": 28.59,
          "en": "for a short time period",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.59,
          "end": 32.16,
          "en": "nothing happens, whilst the request is being sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.16,
          "end": 35.493,
          "en": "But we get no feedback that a request is on its way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.39,
          "end": 38.28,
          "en": "Now, it would be nicer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 40.35,
          "en": "if we would give the user some feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.35,
          "end": 43.77,
          "en": "And for that we can replace this default form element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.77,
          "end": 45.81,
          "en": "with Remix form element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.81,
          "end": 49.53,
          "en": "which you also already saw in the Remix Essentials section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.53,
          "end": 51.96,
          "en": "It's also named form, but it starts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.96,
          "end": 56.96,
          "en": "with a capital F and it's imported from Remix run React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.16,
          "end": 63.183,
          "en": "The closing tag also must be form with a capital F now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.14,
          "end": 67.59,
          "en": "Now what this component does is it basically ensures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.59,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "that we still get this auto-generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 72.78,
          "en": "and automatically send HTDP request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.78,
          "end": 76.2,
          "en": "but it will actually be generated and sent by Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 77.493,
          "en": "behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.57,
          "end": 80.67,
          "en": "Before with the regular form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.67,
          "end": 83.49,
          "en": "the browser generated the request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.49,
          "end": 87.21000000000001,
          "en": "and it's technically loaded a new page, therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.21000000000001,
          "end": 90.543,
          "en": "It sent a request that led to a new page being loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.53,
          "end": 95.00999999999999,
          "en": "With Remix form, we stay in the single page application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.00999999999999,
          "end": 98.61,
          "en": "world instead and the request is sent behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.61,
          "end": 101.78999999999999,
          "en": "On the UI, you don't necessarily see a difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.78999999999999,
          "end": 104.1,
          "en": "but there is a difference technically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.1,
          "end": 106.95,
          "en": "It also ensures that we don't download a new page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.95,
          "end": 109.71000000000001,
          "en": "and all the files that page might need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.71000000000001,
          "end": 110.7,
          "en": "But in addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.7,
          "end": 114.50999999999999,
          "en": "we can now also provide a more convenient user experience,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.50999999999999,
          "end": 118.22999999999999,
          "en": "because we can now show the user some loading state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.22999999999999,
          "end": 120.213,
          "en": "whilst the data is on its way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 124.59,
          "en": "For that, we can import a hook from Remix run React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.59,
          "end": 128.28,
          "en": "which is called use transition at the point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.28,
          "end": 131.25,
          "en": "I'm recording this but which soon will be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.25,
          "end": 134.22,
          "en": "use navigation, and chances are high that it's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 137.253,
          "en": "already called use navigation when you are viewing this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.12,
          "end": 140.55,
          "en": "Simply see if you are getting auto completion for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.55,
          "end": 142.79,
          "en": "use navigation, and if you're not getting it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.79,
          "end": 145.86,
          "en": "and you're instead getting it for use transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.86,
          "end": 147.99,
          "en": "that's still the right hook to import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.99,
          "end": 149.673,
          "en": "but in the future it will change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.11,
          "end": 153.97,
          "en": "Now here I'll simply rename it to use navigation so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.97,
          "end": 157.5,
          "en": "that I'm already using that updated name in my code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.5,
          "end": 161.64,
          "en": "And if we call use navigation, we get a navigation object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.64,
          "end": 165.24,
          "en": "which as already shown in the Remix Essentials section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.24,
          "end": 168.06,
          "en": "has various properties that give you information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.06,
          "end": 171.48,
          "en": "about the navigation that's currently going on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.48,
          "end": 174.633,
          "en": "behind the scenes or the last navigation that finished.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.59,
          "end": 178.65,
          "en": "For example, you can use navigation.state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.65,
          "end": 181.23,
          "en": "To find out whether you're currently submitting data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.23,
          "end": 183.243,
          "en": "loading data, or in a idle mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.23,
          "end": 188.901,
          "en": "And we can, for example, find out if we are submitting data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.901,
          "end": 191.85,
          "en": "by checking if navigation.state is equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.85,
          "end": 195.78,
          "en": "to submitting or better if it's not equal to idle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.78,
          "end": 198.81,
          "en": "Because after submitting, we have a brief period",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.81,
          "end": 202.8,
          "en": "of loading when the loaders are being called again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.8,
          "end": 205.59,
          "en": "because Remix will always call loaders when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.59,
          "end": 207.48,
          "en": "an actual is triggered to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.48,
          "end": 210.24,
          "en": "that all your pages have that latest data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.24,
          "end": 212.473,
          "en": "they load the latest data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.473,
          "end": 215.91,
          "en": "Therefore, here I just wanna check if we're not in idle mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.91,
          "end": 218.85,
          "en": "which tells me that we're either submitting data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.85,
          "end": 221.31,
          "en": "or we finished submitting data and Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 221.31,
          "end": 223.29,
          "en": "is updating the pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.29,
          "end": 226.11,
          "en": "And I simply want to tell the user if anything is happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.11,
          "end": 228.45,
          "en": "behind the scenes and if anything is happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.45,
          "end": 230.79,
          "en": "behind the scenes, I want to update the UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.79,
          "end": 233.73,
          "en": "and show the user that something's going on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.73,
          "end": 235.952,
          "en": "behind the scenes, so that the user doesn't wonder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.952,
          "end": 239.133,
          "en": "whether their form submission is being handled or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 239.97,
          "end": 242.61,
          "en": "So they offer with this helper constant, which is based",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 242.61,
          "end": 246.81,
          "en": "on this navigation information provided by Remix, we can go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.81,
          "end": 250.86,
          "en": "down to this save expense button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.86,
          "end": 253.56,
          "en": "and for example disable this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 253.56,
          "end": 255.994,
          "en": "with the disabled attribute as long",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.994,
          "end": 258.12,
          "en": "as we are submitting data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 258.12,
          "end": 260.32,
          "en": "by simply setting it equal to is submitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 261.6,
          "end": 265.38,
          "en": "And I wanna also change the button caption",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 265.38,
          "end": 266.882,
          "en": "by checking if we are submitting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 266.882,
          "end": 269.54,
          "en": "in which case I'll say saving...",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 270.57,
          "end": 273.581,
          "en": "and only if we're not submitting, I want to say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 273.581,
          "end": 275.013,
          "en": "save expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 275.94,
          "end": 279.57,
          "en": "So with that, we give the users visual feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.57,
          "end": 282.51,
          "en": "that something's going on behind the scenes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 282.51,
          "end": 285.57,
          "en": "and this arguably provides a better user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 285.57,
          "end": 288.09000000000003,
          "en": "And this is something we can only use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 288.09000000000003,
          "end": 290.15999999999997,
          "en": "if we are using Remix form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 290.15999999999997,
          "end": 292.92,
          "en": "with a capital F because it's only working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 292.92,
          "end": 295.05,
          "en": "if we are in a single page application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 295.05,
          "end": 296.79200000000003,
          "en": "and we're not reloading the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 296.79200000000003,
          "end": 299.823,
          "en": "which is what we would do with the regular form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 301.05,
          "end": 302.28,
          "en": "Here, we don't wanna do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 302.28,
          "end": 305.34,
          "en": "We wanna provide that better user experience instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 305.34,
          "end": 307.432,
          "en": "and therefore this is how we update the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 307.432,
          "end": 308.98199999999997,
          "en": "And with that, if we go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 308.98199999999997,
          "end": 311.43,
          "en": "and we add a new expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.43,
          "end": 314.16,
          "en": "Remix course for 1999,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 314.16,
          "end": 315.39,
          "en": "whatever",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 315.39,
          "end": 316.36,
          "en": "and we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 317.31,
          "end": 318.14300000000003,
          "en": "choose a date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 318.14300000000003,
          "end": 321.21,
          "en": "now you see the button updates and we therefore see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 321.21,
          "end": 324.12,
          "en": "that something's going on after clicking that button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 324.12,
          "end": 326.883,
          "en": "and that arguably is a better user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
